{"seq":1,"slug":"pipeline-architecture","title":"管线架构","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/realtime-rendering-pipeline/pipeline-architecture","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"gpu-pipeline-overview","title":"GPU 图形管线全景概览","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/realtime-rendering-pipeline/pipeline-architecture/gpu-pipeline-overview","wordCount":2101,"readingTime":9},{"seq":2,"slug":"vertex-geometry-processing","title":"顶点与几何处理阶段","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/realtime-rendering-pipeline/pipeline-architecture/vertex-geometry-processing","wordCount":1919,"readingTime":8},{"seq":3,"slug":"rasterization-fragment","title":"光栅化与片段处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/realtime-rendering-pipeline/pipeline-architecture/rasterization-fragment","wordCount":2165,"readingTime":9}],"introMarkdown":"# 管线架构\n\n本章从硬件视角出发，解构现代 GPU 图形管线的完整执行流程。\n\n第一篇文档提供 GPU 管线的全景概览，建立从应用提交到帧缓冲输出的完整心智模型。第二篇深入顶点与几何处理阶段，包含顶点着色、曲面细分与几何着色器的协作机制。第三篇聚焦光栅化与片段处理，阐述三角形如何变为像素、片段着色器如何计算最终颜色。\n\n这三篇共同回答一个核心问题：一次 Draw Call 提交后，数据在 GPU 内部经历了怎样的变换与筛选，最终成为屏幕上的像素。理解这一流程是后续所有渲染技术与优化手段的基础。\n"}